{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_12\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 12</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_12\">Problem 12</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 12\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/5322d08b6af2119cb1176c4c5d29209cabc0db2c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); pair A=(-2,0),B,C=(-1,0),D=(1,0),EE,O=(0,0); draw(arc(O,1, 0, 180)); EE=midpoint(arc(O,1, 0, 90)); draw(A--EE); draw(A--D); B=intersectionpoint(arc(O,1, 180, 0),EE--A); draw(O--EE); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,NW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,S);label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,E);label(&quot;$E$&quot;,EE,NE);label(&quot;$O$&quot;,O,S);label(&quot;$45^\\circ$&quot;,(0.25,0.1),fontsize(10pt)); //Credit to TheMaskedMagician for the diagram[/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"118\" />\n</p><p>In the adjoining figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is the diameter of a semi-circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> lies on the extension of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e525b776c49bbe7d0ae66cfc7ab8f58f40624e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> past <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />; \npoint <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on the semi-circle, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the point of intersection (distinct from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> ) of line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> with the semi-circle. \nIf length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> equals length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/46569d6dd3fa86f698827e8de15b0480e1733d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, and the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/e/88efb728405017615f6e090a85c3fd068791a6c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle EOD$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8adb649f063149ebc97d3ee58c4fd38d4c440846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />, then the\nmeasure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a3f50dbc3b56f6a44b836e152c4fde4e60813d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle BAO$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0be95a447cdd5dcd245bbd5faeaf35e1e0f4e5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }10^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }15^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }20^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }25^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"439\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/4/4c4f8744635094adeabf176f22dbffe5ecc65f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = OD$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/890bd5d40a42153edcb992ad0a14cac52ca2eaf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABO$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b457c0c99f0ddd2129acf2229b0036ef05f01c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BOE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> are isosceles. Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53fc23a110a79f0c1efcad701403c5c944dd0cc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle BAO = \\measuredangle AOB = \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"168\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/6/82619a41c2977f5164aaba98d171543d2897f521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle ABO = 180^\\circ-2\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"154\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/e/b4e2b06e5ae88e5c87fc709bb05de3f64303bfd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle EBO = \\measuredangle OEB = 2\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"178\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/a/f2aa13aabbcb51f721f18c693a6fe151cef54c84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle BOE = 180^\\circ-4\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"155\" height=\"13\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c52baaba226b880a5f22b45b51cdd0aebab63586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle AOB + \\measuredangle BOE + 45^\\circ = 180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"239\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd4019bfe8c169e3f672d468502269a4172f0a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta+180-4\\theta = 135^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"156\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/3/7034529ca0886804087cad2ced97a58c003245d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 15^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"105\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Draw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac69127bb7a97d71d1cf903e964140436bea116.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BO$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/7/2a7b9e6abba1f2c673c098a7440798ae247b0fa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\angle BAO$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/5/aa5db62119f095142a276a1a9cab80bc8b8c68e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = OD = BO$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"138\" height=\"14\" />, triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/890bd5d40a42153edcb992ad0a14cac52ca2eaf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABO$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/0/9409db42f7606d84add34098561fca2f81b80797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BOA = \\angle BAO = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"168\" height=\"16\" />. Angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/d/0ed348df2f49e45df3cb5b9fb8195c3660d242b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EBO$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" /> is exterior to triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/890bd5d40a42153edcb992ad0a14cac52ca2eaf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABO$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/d/37d4241f9a00066a12b14b118c8c4b24368b0980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EBO = \\angle BAO + \\angle BOA = y + y = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"322\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/a/c2a21c9447376d1309cff33d27acb1d13e5e8ed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BEO$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> is isosceles, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/0/850c48c570220cb4ce158240d8e8c80888c009d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BEO = \\angle EBO = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/6/fe6d4ee02a2d0c015cf44d99442f8af76c71a888.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EOD$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> is external to triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f7378e51d574820f380395dd3293cdb31695bd65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AEO$\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79e498e2da3ba733717d2abfde8b52b9f6a191f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EOD = \\angle EAO + \\angle AEO = y + 2y = 3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"331\" height=\"16\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9b006fe64696c6c85a810e6a236a7fb06d92d23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EOD = 45^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ff97f9b1adedd3369ccd26528287a8417ad35b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAO = y = 45^\\circ/3 = \\boxed{15^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"219\" height=\"24\" />. That means the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/7/c27fd956281aa80d14f1f461089810b3d9e30813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 15^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"72\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016215607\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 281/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8143/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.916      1 -total\n 76.36%   19.790      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 22.79%    5.907      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15265:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016215607 and revision id 156205. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}